OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Inflation and borrowing
OL,4,Afigures illustrate chancellor's Budget
OL,5,Achallenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chancellor was on an early flight
OL,8,Fto North East Scotland on Wednesday to
OL,9,Fannounce new North Sea energy approvals
OL,10,Fas the last set of major economic
OL,11,Ffigures dropped.
OL,13,FFrom a mile high, as well as close up,
OL,14,Fthe figures for inflation and for the
OL,15,Fpublic finances set out his Budget
OL,16,Fbalancing act in clear terms.
OL,18,FThe National Debt has topped #3
OL,19,Ftrillion for the first time in the
OL,20,Fofficial figures.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
